TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Beni de bir ara evine
davet etsene?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Bu kadar üstelediğim için kusura bakma.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Odanı iyice inceleyip kendi odama birkaç
fikir aşırmak
istiyorum da{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Olur!
Şimdi olmaz.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mi sento un poquito incómodo
a parlare qui in piedi così{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, se per te va bene,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
che ne diresti di andare a casa tua
ora, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
In questo modo,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} potremmo parlare
con calma e conoscerci meglio.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}no, rilassati!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non voglio venderti
enciclopedie o pentole a pressione{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sono uno guapo, non un venditore!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Allora che mi dici?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Posso venire a casa tua?{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
Certo, andiamo!
Un'altra volta, eh?!
